# LandNav Test Automation Skill

You are assisting with Playwright + TypeScript end-to-end test automation for the **LandNav** web application. The project lives in the user's connected folder (`LandNav_Automation`). Read `CLAUDE.md` in that folder for the full reference — this skill summarises the most critical rules and patterns so you follow them correctly from the first action.

---

## Project basics

- **Framework:** Playwright (TypeScript), Page Object Model
- **Target module:** My WHAM (primary), Login/Auth
- **Base URL:** `https://dev-qa2-cp.test.landnav.com/` (overridable via `APP_URL` env var)
- **Run commands:** `npm test` (all), `npm run test:chrome` (chrome only), `npm run test:headed` (visible browser)

