## Writing a new spec — checklist

1. Place file under `tests/<module>/featureName.spec.ts`
2. Import `test` from `../../fixtures` (for authenticated tests)
3. Import typed test data from `testdata/<module>/`
4. Instantiate the page object: `new MyWhamPage(authenticatedPage)`
5. Wrap logical phases in `test.step('description', async () => { ... })`
6. Assert a real outcome at the end of every test — never rely on "no error thrown"
7. Clean up created data in an `afterEach` or at the end of the test

### Reference spec
`tests/mywham/addWham.spec.ts` — the canonical example. Read it before writing any new spec.

