## Auth / session notes

- Auth state is saved to `.playwright/.auth/user.json` by the `setup` project
- If session expires mid-run, delete `user.json` and re-run — setup will re-authenticate
- `auth.setup.spec.ts` uses `LoginPage` PO, confirms login via `heading { name: /Welcome/i }`, then saves storage state
- Never add `dependencies: ['setup']` to the `login` project — it tests unauthenticated flows

